// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P211947921" "I just spoke to Sarah Peters, an FCC investigator who tracks illegal radio broadcasts. She's intercepted some messages from Council soldiers. It seems they're planning to steal a powerful artifact that the government's been trying to protect for decades. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Please meet Sarah Peters and talk to her about the theft.</A> "
// AcceptString :
"P256757683" "Meet Sarah Peters and talk to her about the theft"
